completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.7.1.stable, commit  \n\nCompile-time error, so no runtime version comparison needed.\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 x86_64\n\n### Issue description\nBuilding from source, compilation dies at modules/text_server_fb/thorvg_svg_in_ot.cpp.\n\nLine 330 uses std::unique_ptr but the file never includes <memory>.\nThe compiler literally tells you to add it (see note in log).\nThe other two errors are just fallout from the first one, not separate bugs.\n\nLog:\n```\nERROR: modules\\text_server_fb\\thorvg_svg_in_ot.cpp: In function 'FT_Error tvg_svg_in_ot_render(FT_GlyphSlot, void**)':\nmodules\\text_server_fb\\thorvg_svg_in_ot.cpp:330:14: error: 'unique_ptr' is not a member of 'std'\n330 | std::unique_ptrtvg::SwCanvas sw_canvas(tvg::SwCanvas::gen());\n| ^~~~~~~~~~\nmodules\\text_server_fb\\thorvg_svg_in_ot.cpp:35:1: note: 'std::unique_ptr' is defined in header ''; this is probably fixable by adding '#include '\n34 | #include \"core/io/xml_parser.h\"\n+++ |+#include\n35 | #include \"core/os/memory.h\"\nmodules\\text_server_fb\\thorvg_svg_in_ot.cpp:330:38: error: expected primary-expression before '>' token\nmodules\\text_server_fb\\thorvg_svg_in_ot.cpp:330:40: error: 'sw_canvas' was not declared in this scope\nscons: *** [bin\\obj\\modules\\text_server_fb\\thorvg_svg_in_ot.windows.template_release.x86_64.nothreads.o] Error 1\nscons: building terminated because of errors.\n```\n\nFix is just adding #include <memory> after the xml_parser include.\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nscons platform=windows target=template_release arch=x86_64 threads=no\nFails when it hits thorvg_svg_in_ot.cpp.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A, engine source build failure.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url